{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Science or Science Fiction?", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Technological Innovations", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Exchange information about unlikely events or fairly certain conditions that will be fulfilled in present, past or future  in spoken or written texts and in work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn11le04ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Real Conditional: Expressing Truth Conditions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Real Conditional to talk about true conditions in the present or in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "If it is to be believed, they are a step closer to reality thanks to a new breakthrough in technology.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You use both <span class=\"italic\">if </span>and <span class=\"italic\">when</span> in the Present Real Conditional. When you want to talk about true conditions, <span class=\"italic\">If </span>and <span class=\"italic\">When</span> have the same meaning.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br> <span class=\"italic\">If you want to keep powering your smartphone, pick up a glass and fabric-based thermoelectric generator.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Notice the structure of this type of conditional: <br> If / When ... Simple Present ..., ... Simple Present \u2026", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the examples from the text:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If this happens smaller, cheaper, easier to use devices are on their way!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If the new round of universal translators are any indication, they are ready to use yet. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If you want a machine to recognize voices, it is much harder than originally thought, it seems.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Verbs Followed by -ing", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about two actions linked together, you normally use two verbs. The first verb follows the rules of conjugation for the sentence, while the second verb can be a verb in the -ing form.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The researchers report finding this technology can be used to make better compact medical scanning gadgets. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You can use two verbs to talk about two connected actions. The main verb introduces the main action, and the second verb in the -ing form gives more information about that action.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use a variety of verbs followed by a verb in the -ing form. Some of these verbs are related in meaning, or have opposite meanings, like: <br> <span class=\"italic\">like/dislike, start/stop, can't bear/stand, love/adore/hate, allow/forbid, admit/deny, quit/finish, appreciate/resent ...</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Other verbs followed by verbs in -ing are prepositional verbs like <span class=\"italic\">end up, carry on, keep on, go on, \u2026</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Structure: <br> Subject + first verb + -ing form of the second verb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at some examples from the text:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Try using a device that is not word perfect. Start a conversation by insulting the person you are speaking to.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If you employ the machine at this time, that is exactly what it ends up doing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "So innovations are coming, some faster than others. Scientists never think about giving up. They are always interested in moving forward.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to power", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to provide something with the energy it needs to operate", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If this technology works you can one day power your smartphone by using just body heat.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le04ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about technology in the future.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "generator ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a machine which produces electricity", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If you want to keep powering your smartphone, pick up one of the new thermoelectric generators.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le04ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to employ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to use", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If you employ the machine at this time, that is exactly what it ends up doing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le04ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to convert", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to \u200bchange the \u200bcharacter, \u200bappearance, or \u200boperation of something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The thermoelectric generator can actually convert heat into energy - electrical energy! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le04ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "surrounding ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "all around a particular place or thing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It produces power by using the slight difference in temperature between your skin and the air surrounding it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le04ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "scanner ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a machine which reads information and puts it into a computer system", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Remember watching people use those handheld medical scanners on Star Trek? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le04ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "indication ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a sign that something exists, is true, or likely to happen", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If the new round of universal translators are any indication, they aren't ready to use yet.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le04ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "In the 1960s Star Trek was an innovative new futuristic series, where many new technological items were used.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do some reading (or listening) to find out how many of these technologies have actually come to be. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a brief summary of 5 items, tying it to what we use or will soon be using.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your summaries to a partner or group and discuss them.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I read about or listen to descriptions of items now or soon in use previewed on Star Trek.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a brief summary of 5 items.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use the real conditional.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I tie the items to what is now or will soon be in use. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my summaries and discuss them.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about technology and gadgets.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can introduce conditions under which something is true.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about two actions together.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What new highly innovative gadgets have you heard or read about?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How many modern gadgets do you own, and what are they?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "The future is here!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">Powering</span> your smartphone with a thermoelectric generator!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"c